:memory:.ses
*.onnx
*.ckpt

# Secrets
.env
.env.local

# Personal case-study working notes -- never public, stays on this Mac only.
Case study notes.md
case study prmpting.md

# OS
.DS_Store

# Vercel CLI project link (repo-root copy -- see app/STATUS.md for why the
