.vercel

# Source/processed audio — personal, often large, not something to version control
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a

# Phase 0 spike: source songs and all generated output (stems, MIDI, anything
# derived from a copyrighted recording) — local-only, never published. The
# text docs in this folder (RESULTS.md, README.md) are NOT covered by this
# and stay tracked — they describe findings, they don't reproduce any song.
research/00_spike/audio/
research/00_spike/output/

# Reference/inspiration images (at least one third-party-sourced, e.g. watermarked)
# -- kept local for browsing, not something to republish.
research/00_spike/fretboard/

# Real pipeline runs: a copy of the source audio plus everything each stage
# generates from it. Same copyright reasoning as research/00_spike/ above --
# never published, regenerable from the original file.
pipeline_runs/
